iginal%20source%20buffers%2C%20retaining%20identities%2C%20cycles%2C%20roots%2C%20full%20CSTs%20and%20proofs.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoverySnapshotsReloadWithoutSource%27%2C%20%27linkCliTextAndVersionedBinaryAgree%27%2C%20%27snapshotIdentitiesRootsTreesAndProofsRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-DYNAMIC-TRANSLATION%27%2C%20%27discovered%20languages%20execute%20and%20translate%20in%20the%20generic%20runtime%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27After%20installing%20a%20discovered%20language%20dynamically%2C%20ordinary%20parsing%20and%20Rust%2FJavaScript%20translation%20execute%20through%20the%20common%20algorithms.%20Changing%20a%20linked%20definition%20changes%20execution%20without%20changing%20the%20generic%20host%20runtime%3B%20stale%20certificates%20and%20incompatible%20definitions%20are%20rejected%20or%20revalidated%20explicitly.%27%2C%20%5B%27discoveredLanguageParsesAndTranslates%27%2C%20%27linkedMutationChangesGenericExecution%27%2C%20%27staleCertificatesRejectedOrRevalidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27dynamicKnowledgeRequest%27%2C%20dynamicSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Resource%20Description%20Framework%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20preserve%20the%20complete%20required%20RDF%20constructs%2C%20identities%2C%20relationships%2C%20literals%2C%20provenance%20and%20selected%20semantics%20as%20inspectable%20links.%20A%20finite%20triple%20example%20or%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20full%20RDF%20support.%27%2C%20%5B%27rdfConstructsPreserved%27%2C%20%27rdfSemanticsAndProvenanceExplicit%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-OWL-SUPPORT%27%2C%20%27full%20Web%20Ontology%20Language%20representation%20and%20operations%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20represent%20the%20required%20OWL%20constructs%2C%20formal%20axioms%20and%20chosen%20semantic%20profiles%20as%20links%2C%20preserving%20distinctions%20and%20obligations%20without%20silently%20replacing%20the%20consumer%20foundation.%27%2C%20%5B%27owlConstructsAndAxiomsPreserved%27%2C%20%27owlSemanticProfilesExplicit%27%2C%20%27consumerFoundationRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-IMPORT%27%2C%20%27complete%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20importers%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Public%20importers%20in%20both%20packages%20import%20required%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20representations%20into%20the%20common%20concept%20and%20links%20space%20with%20their%20full%20structure%2C%20provenance%20and%20explicit%20diagnostics%20for%20unresolved%20obligations.%27%2C%20%5B%27rdfAndOwlPublicImportersExecuted%27%2C%20%27importedKnowledgeStructureAndProvenanceRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-CONVERSION%27%2C%20%27faithful%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20conversion%20cycles%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Public%20converters%20and%20exporters%20in%20both%20packages%20execute%20faithful%20knowledge-format%20conversion%20cycles%20from%20the%20shared%20representation%20without%20returning%20a%20saved%20input%20or%20silently%20weakening%20axioms%20and%20identities.%27%2C%20%5B%27knowledgeConversionCyclesExecuted%27%2C%20%27knowledgeAxiomsAndIdentitiesPreserved%27%2C%20%27noSavedInputConversionShortcut%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-KNOWLEDGE-RDF-OWL-MERGE%27%2C%20%27meaning-preserving%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20merges%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20merge%20imported%20RDF%20and%20OWL%20knowledge%20through%20the%20common%20links%20space%2C%20deduplicating%20only%20proved%20correspondences%20while%20retaining%20unique%20concepts%2C%20conflicting%20axioms%2C%20uncertainty%20and%20source-qualified%20provenance.%27%2C%20%5B%27knowledgeMergesExecuted%27%2C%20%27knowledgeDeduplicationProved%27%2C%20%27conflictsAndUncertaintyPreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-SNAPSHOT-RECONSTRUCTION%27%2C%20%27static%20snapshot%20becomes%20a%20complete%20dynamic%20representation%20on%20demand%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27A%20prepared%20static%20snapshot%20can%20be%20reconstructed%20on%20demand%20into%20the%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept%20space%2C%20retaining%20rules%2C%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20recursive%20links%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance%20instead%20of%20reconstructing%20a%20token%20list%20or%20descriptor.%27%2C%20%5B%27snapshotReconstructsFullCst%27%2C%20%27snapshotReconstructsFullConceptSpace%27%2C%20%27dynamicReconstructionRetainsProvenance%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-RECONSTRUCTION-RESOURCE-MEASUREMENT%27%2C%20%27measured%20latency%20and%20resources%20for%20complete%20dynamic%20reconstruction%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Both%20packages%20measure%20actual%20complete%20CST%20and%20concept-space%20reconstruction%20through%20the%20public%20link-cli%2C%20text%20Links%20Notation%20and%20binary%20Links%20Notation%20paths.%20Measurements%20record%20reconstruction%20latency%20and%20peak%20resources%20together%20with%20pinned%20input%20identity%2C%20representation%2C%20size%2C%20algorithm%20and%20execution%20environment%20provenance.%20The%20reconstructed%20graphs%20preserve%20the%20complete%20trees%2C%20rules%2C%20recursive%20formal%20definitions%2C%20identities%2C%20references%2C%20selected%20models%2C%20source%20bytes%20and%20provenance.%20Lazy%20loading%2C%20token-only%20reconstruction%20and%20descriptor%20creation%20cannot%20count%20as%20a%20measured%20full%20rebuild.%20These%20measurements%20retain%20the%20source%20qualitative%20speed%20requirement%20without%20inventing%20a%20numeric%20deadline.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27completeDynamicReconstructionMeasured%27%2C%20%27reconstructionLatencyAndResourcesRecorded%27%2C%20%27measurementInputAndEnvironmentProvenanceRetained%27%2C%20%27fullRepresentationPreservationRetained%27%2C%20%27lazyOrTokenOnlyReconstructionNotCounted%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-DYNAMIC-LINK-CLI-RECONST