ity%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Current%20implementation%20priority%20maximizes%20Rust%20to%20editable%20meta-language%20and%20meta-language%20to%20Rust%20translation%2C%20including%20complete%20source%20and%20semantic%20preservation%20obligations.%20Earlier%20languages%2C%20knowledge-format%20support%20and%20inherited%20requirements%20remain%20in%20scope.%27%2C%20%5B%27rustToMetaLanguageExecuted%27%2C%20%27metaLanguageToRustExecuted%27%2C%20%27rustPriorityPreservesInheritedScope%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-TRANSLATION-PRIORITY-JAVASCRIPT%27%2C%20%27immediate%20bidirectional%20JavaScript%20and%20meta-language%20translation%20priority%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Current%20implementation%20priority%20maximizes%20JavaScript%20to%20editable%20meta-language%20and%20meta-language%20to%20JavaScript%20translation%2C%20retaining%20complete%20source%2C%20structures%20and%20semantics%20while%20preserving%20every%20earlier%20requirement.%27%2C%20%5B%27javascriptToMetaLanguageExecuted%27%2C%20%27metaLanguageToJavascriptExecuted%27%2C%20%27javascriptPriorityPreservesInheritedScope%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27multiProjectTranslationRequest%27%2C%20projectSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27translation-priority%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-TRANSLATION-PRIORITY-MULTI-PROJECT%27%2C%20%27reusable%20source%20translation%20across%20multiple%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20projects%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20same%20automated%20translation%20and%20common%20concept%20algorithms%20operate%20on%20multiple%20real%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20projects%20with%20pinned%20inputs%20and%20independent%20behavioral%20validation.%20Project-specific%20source%20rewrites%20or%20carried%20originals%20do%20not%20establish%20successful%20reusable%20executable%20translation.%27%2C%20%5B%27multipleRealProjectsTranslated%27%2C%20%27sharedTranslationAlgorithmsReused%27%2C%20%27projectBehaviorsIndependentlyValidated%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%