I195-ASSOCIATIVE-STACK-PINNED-SOURCE-AUDIT%27%2C%20%27pinned%20audit%20of%20the%20referenced%20associative%20technology%20stack%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20project%20audit%20reads%20the%20referenced%20formal-ai%20associative%20technology%20stack%20at%20a%20recorded%20immutable%20revision%20and%20records%20its%20content%20hash%2C%20providers%20and%20dependency-role%20boundaries.%20A%20moving%20main%20URL%20or%20a%20provider%20name%20alone%20does%20not%20establish%20adoption.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27associativeStackSourceReadAndPinned%27%2C%20%27stackContentHashRecorded%27%2C%20%27providerRolesClassified%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-STACK-PROJECT-WIDE-USE%27%2C%20%27associative%20stack%20adoption%20across%20the%20entire%20project%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27An%20executable%20project-wide%20audit%20covers%20both%20packages%2C%20code%2C%20grammars%2C%20translation%2C%20tools%2C%20documentation%20and%20dependencies%20against%20the%20relevant%20associative%20stack%20obligations.%20Direct%20runtime%20providers%2C%20compatibility%20or%20theoretical%20alignment%20and%20development%20tools%20are%20distinguished%3B%20unrelated%20formal-ai%20dependencies%20are%20not%20blindly%20introduced.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27entireProjectStackUsageAudited%27%2C%20%27actualCodeAndDependenciesTraced%27%2C%20%27runtimeCompatibilityAndDevelopmentRolesDistinct%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-THEORY-FOUNDATION-PINNED-SOURCE-AUDIT%27%2C%20%27pinned%20philosophical%20and%20theoretical%20meta-theory%20foundation%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20meta-theory%20source%20is%20read%20at%20an%20immutable%20revision%20with%20archived%20releases%20and%20drafts%20identified%20separately.%20Adopted%20definitions%2C%20assumptions%20and%20provenance%20are%20recorded%20explicitly%3B%20a%20repository%20citation%20alone%20is%20insufficient%20as%20a%20theoretical%20foundation.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27metaTheorySourceReadAndPinned%27%2C%20%27archivesAndDraf