2C%20checked%20contexts%2C%20translation%20workers%20and%20reports.%20Retain%20every%20individual%20failure%2C%20source%20range%20and%20unresolved%20obligation%3B%20measured%20coverage%20and%20resource%20observations%20are%20required%20before%20claiming%20the%20target%20ratio.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27existingAutomationReused%27%2C%20%27actualSourceFailuresGroupedWithoutLoss%27%2C%20%27highCoverageChangesPrioritized%27%2C%20%27resourceAndCoverageClaimsRequireObservations%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-THREE-SUBAGENT-CURRENT-PHASE%27%2C%20%27up%20to%20three%20subagents%20for%20the%20current%20parallel%20implementation%20phase%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20current%20user%20instruction%20authorizes%20at%20most%20three%20subagents%20to%20speed%20useful%20independent%20work%20after%20the%20historical%20coordinator-only%20phase.%20Preserve%20clear%20source%20ownership%2C%20contributor%20commits%2C%20bounded%20resource%20use%20and%20one%20push%20coordinator%3B%20resource-heavy%20local%20checks%20and%20Git%20index%20writes%20remain%20serialized.%20Earlier%20phase%20instructions%20and%20all%20project%20obligations%20remain%20recorded.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27activeSubagentCountAtMostThree%27%2C%20%27independentSourceOwnershipPreserved%27%2C%20%27contributorCommitsAndSinglePushRetained%27%2C%20%27localHeavyChecksSerialized%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27automationFirstOwnCodebaseBaselineRequest%27%2C%20%27parity%2Fsources%2Fautomation-first-own-codebase-baseline-2026-10-21.txt%27%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27translation-priority%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-TRANSLATION-OWN-CODEBASE-BASELINE%27%2C%20%27complete%20JavaScript%20Rust%20parsing%20emission%20and%20bidirectional%20translation%20as%20the%20first%20own-codebase%20baseline%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Deliver%20full%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20parsing%20and%20source%20emission%2C%20with%20complete%20concrete%20syntax%20by%